@startuml "Meter Submit View Sequence"
skinparam defaultFontSize 18
skinparam defaultFontName "Times New Roman"
actor "Sinh viên" as Student
participant "Giao diện" as FE
participant "StudentController" as SC
database "CSDL" as DB

Student -> FE: Nhập chỉ số điện/nước
FE -> SC: POST /api/student/invoices/meter-reading
SC -> DB: SELECT hợp đồng + hóa đơn tháng trước
DB --> SC: invoice
SC -> DB: UPDATE invoices (electric_end, water_end, total_amount)
DB --> SC: OK
SC --> FE: 200 OK

Student -> FE: Xem hóa đơn
FE -> SC: GET /api/student/invoices
SC -> DB: SELECT invoices by user
DB --> SC: data
SC --> FE: 200 OK
@enduml
